      "evidence_refs": [],
      "proof_refs": [],
      "publication_wording": "INTERPRETATIVE_DECLARATION",
      "scope": "This is the authorial operational definition. A metric proper-time calibration requires an additional physical worldline binding, and a coordinate-future assignment is not a causal-future relation or a record available before its source emission.",
